+## Session Model
+
+Eligible public-channel turns share live context in this agent/community listener. DMs, private and unknown channels are isolated. Follow the current turn’s channel/thread/reply destination, not an earlier turn’s route. Channel canvas and huddle sections apply only to the current turn. Restart, rotation or provider failure may discard live history.
